  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Finance Management and EU accession support for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the public finance management in Ukraine, thereby ultimately improving public service delivery and the business climate and to strengthen Ukraine&#x2019;s resilience by responding to urgent needs by the Ukrainian authorities resulting from the Russian war of aggression in Ukraine  1.	&#x201c;Budget process modernisation, improved control and accountability&#x201d; : to support relevant national institutions in the improvement of budget preparation, implementation and control.  2.	&#x201c;Public Procurement&#x201d; : to support further development of the public procurement system in Ukraine  3.	&#x201c;Revenue Mobilisation&#x201d; : to support further development of a modern, efficient and fair revenue collection system.  4.	&#x201c;Horizontal functions and governance&#x201d; : to support relevant PFM institutions in the enhancement of their organizational capacities  5.	&#x201c;External audit and Parliamentary oversight&#x201d; : to support relevant national institutions in the improvement of accountability for public funds.  Within this bigger framework, Enabel would focus on Public Investment Management (PIM), budget process modernisation, and public accounting.</narrative>
  </description>
